WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.590 --> 00:00:09.689
Thanks for calling the Magic Castle, it's Amber. Yeah sure do, 38 dollars a night.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:19.160
Okay, I warned you one drip and you're out.

00:00:19.340 --> 00:00:19.900
Oh come on!

00:00:20.220 --> 00:00:21.360
Out now.

00:00:21.360 --> 00:00:23.240
It's gonna melt outside.

00:00:23.240 --> 00:00:23.740
It's melting inside too.

00:00:24.160 --> 00:00:24.880
But Bobby

00:00:25.060 --> 00:00:25.860
Out.

00:00:27.360 --> 00:00:29.360
Thank you very much

00:00:29.480 --> 00:00:30.840
You're not welcome!

00:00:33.640 --> 00:00:36.589
The man who lives in here gets arrested a lot

00:00:36.589 --> 00:00:40.980
These are the rooms we're not supposed to go in but let's go anyway!

00:00:43.880 --> 00:00:45.700
Could you give us some change please?

00:00:45.700 --> 00:00:49.560
The doctor said we have asthma and we gotta eat ice cream right away

00:00:49.560 --> 00:00:50.660
Here you go

00:00:53.220 --> 00:00:55.580
Halley, we've got a situation here open up

00:00:55.580 --> 00:01:00.000
It's only second week of the summer, and there's already been a dead fish in the pool

00:01:00.180 --> 00:01:02.060
We were trying to get it back alive.

00:01:02.500 --> 00:01:04.500
Water balloons thrown at tourists.

00:01:07.660 --> 00:01:09.400
I failed as a mother Moonee

00:01:09.400 --> 00:01:11.080
Yeah Mom you're a disgrace

00:01:12.840 --> 00:01:17.360
New job? Yeah. If you're working who's looking after Moonee?

00:01:17.360 --> 00:01:18.960
You're not my father!

00:01:19.380 --> 00:01:21.880
I don't want to be your father.
You can't treat me like this!

00:01:24.660 --> 00:01:27.900
You don't think everybody knows what's up Halley? Everybody.

00:01:31.140 --> 00:01:35.599
She's about to cry. I can always tell when adults are about to cry.

00:01:38.720 --> 00:01:42.340
Why is my mum yelling? They're just talking, they gotta figure something out.

00:01:50.200 --> 00:01:52.200
See! I took you on a safari.

00:01:58.140 --> 00:02:00.560
Woah, let's go. Come on!

00:02:04.380 --> 00:02:06.380
Have a nice day

00:02:06.380 --> 00:02:08.380
Love you Bobby!

00:02:08.580 --> 00:02:10.580
I love you, too

